@c change a binding there and run make; make check fails on any difference.

In an editor window the Windows and menus, Programming, Debugger and
Editing tables are read in that order: a key that an earlier table
binds acts there and never reaches a later one.  The Programming and
Debugger tables apply in wpe and xwpe only.  The Help viewer's and the
Watches window's own keys are read first in those windows, and win.  A
cell with no key means the style binds none.

