@subsection Which terminals deliver the Modern keys

A key marked protocol is a key of its own only in a terminal that
implements xterm's modifyOtherKeys or kitty's keyboard protocol, which
the editor asks for.  The record of what each terminal was measured to
send is docs/chapters/keys-delivery.txt in the source.

